00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:13.760
 to light, it means they're leaking CSF from that tiny puncture hole in their lower back.

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:14.760
 A spinal headache.

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:15.760
 Yeah.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:20.840
