00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.400
 Let's trace the fluid dynamics here.

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:23.400
 That's a great question.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:28.640
 The brain and the spinal cord share a continuous, closed fluid environment.

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:31.080
 The brain doesn't just sit on the hard bone of the skull.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:35.320
 It essentially floats in a buoyant cushion of cerebrospinal fluid.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.320
