00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.200
 Just acting off.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.200
 Right.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.840
 They might be able to tell you their name, but they think it's 1998.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:25.800
