00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:02.920
 The upper floors.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:03.920
 Yes.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:08.120
 No cognitive function, no awareness of themselves or their environment.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:12.240
 The upper floors of our house analogy are completely destroyed.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:15.120
 But the basement generator is still running.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.120
 Yes.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.720
