00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.200
 This is the stuff of nightmares.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.360
 Truly.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:02.000
 The brainstem suffers a very specific injury, often a stroke in the pawns that severs the

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.880
