00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:28.320
 The guide refers to these late signs as Cushing's Triad.

00:25:28.320 --> 00:25:31.920
 Break down what's actually happening when a patient hits Cushing's Triad.

00:25:31.920 --> 00:25:36.600
 Cushing's Triad means this swelling has become so severe that it is physically crushing the

00:25:36.600 --> 00:25:39.480
 brain stem down to the base of the skull.

00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:41.440
 The brain stem is panicking.

00:25:41.440 --> 00:25:44.840
 The Triad consists of three very specific classic signs.

00:25:44.840 --> 00:25:46.520
 What's the first one?

00:25:46.520 --> 00:25:50.720
